nformative.\n- **B6 \u2013 Yes.** Shared templates, a shared descriptor pattern and settlement through A to D justify investigating the accounts together. This does not prove they are one operation.\n\nRESULT CO-041 | A1: Cannot tell | A2: Cannot tell | A3: No, not by itself | A4: No | A5: Yes | B1: No | B2: No | B3: No | B4: No | B5: No | B6: Yes"
